abstract: >-
  A task-management REST API and CLI in Python (FastAPI, SQLAlchemy) with
  JWT authentication, SQL-side querying, a bounded logistic urgency model for
  task ranking verified by property-based tests, rate limiting, structured
  logging and Prometheus metrics.
keywords:
  - task management
  - fastapi
  - sqlalchemy
  - scheduling
  - urgency scoring
